    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sing Together : Earth\u2019s Biggest Karaoke</h2>Sing Together is a VR karaoke that aims to be the Earth's Biggest Karaoke.<br>Sing your favorite songs, from the latest hits to old favorites, with people from all over the world in a variety of spaces<br>Sing Together is open 24 hours a day!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different Spaces For Singing</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/bfa420ac82aec048645360ff373060e2.poster.avif?t=1700633020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/bfa420ac82aec048645360ff373060e2.webm?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/bfa420ac82aec048645360ff373060e2.mp4?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>K-Karaoke rooms, concert halls, solo booths, and more!<br>We'll be adding more spaces for unique experiences in the future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Microphone Effects</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/c33be34ac636b17d81683b007bebf081.poster.avif?t=1700633020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/c33be34ac636b17d81683b007bebf081.webm?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/c33be34ac636b17d81683b007bebf081.mp4?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Echo and more microphone effects!<br>We want to make your singing experience enjoyable with continuous microphone upgrades.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sing With People Around the World</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/66aafca6a58877a7c0963e5063cee466.poster.avif?t=1700633020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/66aafca6a58877a7c0963e5063cee466.webm?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/66aafca6a58877a7c0963e5063cee466.mp4?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Sing along with us through multiplayer!<br>Sing, listen, and share your favorite songs with people from all over the world.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sing Together : Earth\u2019s Biggest Karaoke</h2>Sing Together is a VR karaoke that aims to be the Earth's Biggest Karaoke.<br>Sing your favorite songs, from the latest hits to old favorites, with people from all over the world in a variety of spaces<br>Sing Together is open 24 hours a day!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Different Spaces For Singing</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/bfa420ac82aec048645360ff373060e2.poster.avif?t=1700633020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/bfa420ac82aec048645360ff373060e2.webm?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/bfa420ac82aec048645360ff373060e2.mp4?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>K-Karaoke rooms, concert halls, solo booths, and more!<br>We'll be adding more spaces for unique experiences in the future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Microphone Effects</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/c33be34ac636b17d81683b007bebf081.poster.avif?t=1700633020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/c33be34ac636b17d81683b007bebf081.webm?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/c33be34ac636b17d81683b007bebf081.mp4?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Echo and more microphone effects!<br>We want to make your singing experience enjoyable with continuous microphone upgrades.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Sing With People Around the World</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/66aafca6a58877a7c0963e5063cee466.poster.avif?t=1700633020\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/66aafca6a58877a7c0963e5063cee466.webm?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1781140/extras/66aafca6a58877a7c0963e5063cee466.mp4?t=1700633020\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Sing along with us through multiplayer!<br>Sing, listen, and share your favorite songs with people from all over the world.",
